  "label": "Map and timeline",
  "offered": true,
  "description": "A map or a line of time as the stage: crisp navy pen lines on pale chart paper, land in a soft wash, routes and borders drawn on in a brick red, the places and dates that matter in a sea teal, a classic serif for titles over a clean sans for place names, glides across the map from one place to the next and a quiet dip between scenes. Suits history, geography, exploration, trade, migration, wars and empires, the spread of an idea or a disease, and anything where where and when are the story.",
